2016..2090 Comment "/// A path at every loop whose inverse arm drops its rest\'s path: each arm"
2091..2172 Comment "/// checks at its letter, but at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the loop arm carries"
2173..2253 Comment "/// the inverse arm\'s reflexivity to `here(loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q)`, which is"
2254..2329 Comment "/// not the path at `q` the cancellation\'s right side reads. Read as a set,"
2330..2398 Comment "/// the loops would identify the two; the words are not read as one."
